\title{linearAlgebra: Linear Algebra Helpers}
\author{Ivan Jacob Agaloos Pesigan}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\section*{Description}

Linear algebra helpers:
vectorization and half-vectorization,
symmetric matrices from their half-vectorization,
the duplication matrix and its Moore-Penrose inverse,
deviation scores,
and tests for symmetric and positive definite matrices.
Each exported function has an internal version without input checks
that other projects can copy.

\section*{Installation}

You can install the development version of \texttt{linearAlgebra} from
\href{https://github.com/ijapesigan/linearAlgebra}{GitHub} with:

%% begin.rcode
% #| eval = FALSE
% if (!requireNamespace(package = "pak", quietly = TRUE)) {
%   utils::install.packages(pkgs = "pak")
% }
% pak::pkg_install(pkg = "ijapesigan/linearAlgebra")
%% end.rcode

\section*{More Information}

See
\href{https://ijapesigan.github.io/linearAlgebra/index.html}{GitHub Pages}
for package documentation.

